※ pl4g-test: compile=ok run=native,qemu exit=42 diag=none

※ A call is an expression, so it may stand wherever one may -- including as
※ the argument of another call, and on either side of an operator.

fn add_one(n: u8) → u8:
    n ⊞ 1u8

fn add_two(n: u8) → u8:
    add_one(add_one(n))

@[startup]
fn main() → u8:
    add_two(40u8) ⊞ add_two(0u8) ⊟ 2u8
